{
  "title": "Elusive Muse",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "A deck of 1,000",
        "short prompts for",
        "when you are stuck.",
        "Click, and one card",
        "comes out of the",
        "static, with a few",
        "glassy notes.",
        "",
        "Your audio passes",
        "through untouched.",
        "",
        "In the spirit of",
        "Oblique Strategies",
        "by Brian Eno and",
        "Peter Schmidt. All",
        "the cards are new."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Controls",
      "lines": [
        "Click: enter page",
        "Click again: draw",
        "  a card",
        "Tap Shift: mute or",
        "  unmute its notes",
        "  (an M shows)",
        "Back: leave page",
        "",
        "A click while the",
        "card is coming is",
        "ignored: the deck",
        "chooses, not you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The deck",
      "lines": [
        "Cards are dealt like",
        "a shuffled deck: you",
        "see all 1,000 before",
        "any card repeats.",
        "",
        "The notes go to the",
        "effects after it in",
        "the slot. Put it",
        "last to keep them",
        "dry."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
